node_modules
.yarn/*
!.yarn/releases
.DS_Store
.vitest/
dist/
__screenshots__/

# Epic UI's waiting comments (`<page>.inbox.json5` beside a page, and its lock):  per machine, never the record
/src/docs/**/*.inbox.json*
# and their comments files (`<page>.comments.<person>.json5`, epic epic-friend P9):  shared only in the content repo
/src/docs/**/*.comments.*.json5

# a checkout's running agents when it has no epic (`epic agents`)
/.spell-agents.json5

# the plan-doc checks' screenshots (`src/demo/`)
/src/demo/shots/

# the VS Code window files (`epic window`, src/window.mjs):  per machine, written when missing -- the repo's window
# (`workspaces/spell-epic.code-workspace`) by `epic window open | launch | init`, a worktree's (`workspaces/ongoing/`)
# by `open`.  Its `windowsFolder` (.epic/config.json5) keeps them here (epic `epic-engine` I15, J3;  `epic-eject` P13)
/workspaces/

# `spell map`'s map of this repo (graphify's, epic coherence P1):  rebuilt on demand, never committed
graphify-out/
